{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "This is version two of my reporting schema used for Focused Care Solutions reporting to case managers.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/94dab1487cc8321364c0e2d911ddebed4fa93a616a745c91b4267ec6130b6dd9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.62], [4, 0.94, 1.26], [6, 1.36, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 2.18], [8, 2.18, 2.5], [9, 2.5, 2.7], [11, 3.02, 3.28], [12, 3.28, 3.78], [13, 3.78, 4.3], [14, 4.3, 4.58], [15, 4.58, 4.74], [16, 4.74, 5.14]]}, {"text": "This pattern follows contains a lot of the benefits of the first one, except hides a lot of the code messiness.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8d0c3f47794a2bf91f0e14e3f2445d118c4817405f55b978055db7ff14f058fc.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.46], [5, 1.46, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.7], [7, 1.7, 1.78], [8, 1.78, 2.12], [9, 2.12, 2.36], [10, 2.36, 2.5], [11, 2.5, 2.76], [12, 2.76, 3.1], [13, 3.44, 3.7], [14, 3.7, 4.12], [15, 4.12, 4.24], [16, 4.24, 4.36], [17, 4.36, 4.48], [18, 4.48, 4.56], [19, 4.56, 4.74], [20, 4.74, 5.18]]}, {"text": "Goodbye lib/reports.rb", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7ec8a92520a634b7a5616a8c19ba1b539315ede11501de686cc84f582488840d.mp3"}, {"text": "I hated how cluttered and ugly reports.rb got.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/703fe03f493676e6a353bd02bfb6b5feb01c0a6fd904d9de4bd6efdc9bdc76de.mp3"}, {"text": "It ended being a graveyard for code decay causing a massive file (+500 lines of SQL/Ruby code) making it crazy difficult to maintain and find things in.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7cbeff0299c891afaef6d67eced4352cea180fdc3e0f2dfb4c5665f683de0967.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.5], [6, 1.5, 1.7], [7, 1.7, 2.02], [8, 2.26, 2.5], [9, 2.5, 2.64], [10, 2.64, 2.92], [11, 2.92, 3.34], [12, 3.6, 4.0], [13, 4.0, 4.26], [14, 4.26, 4.48], [16, 5.02, 5.42], [17, 5.78, 5.92], [18, 5.92, 6.14], [19, 6.14, 6.4], [20, 6.4, 6.88], [21, 6.88, 7.08], [22, 7.08, 7.4], [23, 7.4, 7.62], [24, 7.62, 7.8], [25, 7.8, 8.02], [26, 8.02, 8.28]]}, {"text": "Sooo much scrolling.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1dd8a7ca773b7a9c35efc54b756325df485fc105875e49ac43115fe501c4f960.mp3"}, {"text": "Hello migrations!", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/103bf94d5454e5978edd3dcab7c0876085caedd69db470d870171f468ea4cfa0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.82]]}, {"text": "This time I moved all of my SQL to be the data layer.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d0560db8dc84b73f684c97d4806ecd958001166a94d0338e082b9da350216cb9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.74], [4, 0.74, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.1], [6, 1.1, 1.22], [8, 1.58, 1.82], [9, 1.82, 1.94], [10, 1.94, 2.06], [12, 2.28, 2.56]]}, {"text": "Everything was self contained in a reporting row.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/75eb8cb4e02bc0e05b487aec5064121540d94f0f7e77f327a92baae6b2b446a9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.46], [5, 1.46, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.92], [7, 1.92, 2.22]]}, {"text": "```ruby _create_reports.rb create_table :reports, id: :uuid do |t| t.string :name t.text :sql t.timestamps end", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8fcde0d83d40a198deff82c5b697c09a3b041206184635bc7e98f824ab7a97f4.mp3"}, {"text": "This way, new developers only and new deployments have to run migrations when they are setting up a new box and you get a history of what each report was.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/86b8e96d07cd251451dbcc9dd333e701080e59b94d0916c736eb78e9f498d46a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.48], [2, 0.98, 1.08], [3, 1.08, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 1.96], [5, 1.96, 2.36], [6, 2.36, 2.56], [7, 2.56, 3.02], [8, 3.02, 3.22], [9, 3.22, 3.42], [10, 3.42, 3.54], [11, 3.54, 4.1], [12, 4.1, 4.44], [13, 4.44, 4.6], [14, 4.6, 4.7], [15, 4.7, 4.96], [16, 4.96, 5.14], [17, 5.14, 5.22], [18, 5.22, 5.36], [19, 5.36, 5.68], [20, 5.96, 6.02], [21, 6.02, 6.12], [22, 6.12, 6.22], [23, 6.22, 6.32], [24, 6.32, 6.62], [25, 6.62, 6.88], [26, 6.88, 6.98], [27, 6.98, 7.18], [28, 7.18, 7.46], [29, 7.46, 7.82]]}, {"text": "If you want to edit a report, find it by the name and change the SQL code.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/216b394ebe9775fdd623363e588f40ba73982af0fbf07cacb67373133e1d436d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.58], [4, 0.58, 0.7], [5, 0.7, 0.84], [6, 0.84, 1.16], [7, 1.7, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.02], [9, 2.02, 2.14], [10, 2.14, 2.3], [11, 2.3, 2.5], [12, 2.5, 2.92], [13, 2.92, 3.16], [14, 3.16, 3.38], [15, 3.38, 3.66], [16, 3.66, 3.98]]}, {"text": "reports_controler.rb", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ba428b65e459fce4a6f162a85e68c5049402f8d5debf1d718398da2b2709a513.mp3"}, {"text": "I broke reports controller into two controller files.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d6451b40c0245ca108fa844a581a00ac9a69256984c277498fab5bd33d6942ce.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.26], [4, 1.26, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.52]]}, {"text": "One going in the API folder and one going in the top level reports folder.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/07e02386b90cb5b80bd4b6996f7ec89c89bda9e49eddc43886d5dcf7fa749ec4.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.58, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.6], [6, 1.6, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.44], [10, 2.44, 2.54], [11, 2.54, 2.72], [12, 2.72, 2.98], [13, 2.98, 3.3], [14, 3.3, 3.78]]}, {"text": "The top level folder handles all of the HTML methods with reporting while the API actually runs the report.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f1c2f099dec4b4d246e31c6fd8c5fcb296160ffc0bed1ec0ddf317620d9b93c5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.84], [6, 1.84, 2.0], [7, 2.0, 2.12], [8, 2.12, 2.52], [9, 2.52, 3.0], [12, 3.74, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.02], [14, 4.02, 4.38], [15, 4.38, 4.84], [16, 4.84, 5.12], [18, 5.3, 5.6]]}, {"text": "This way the users aren’t stuck with a long page load time while the report is being run and I can leverage AngularJS to display the report results.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/90327f71fddb8dc2cbb45e02db5d75bb4cfa5071e1ae24934a2531a27a70720c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.08], [9, 2.08, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.72], [11, 2.72, 3.1], [12, 3.1, 3.3], [13, 3.3, 3.4], [14, 3.4, 3.66], [15, 3.66, 3.9], [16, 3.9, 4.14], [17, 4.14, 4.46], [18, 4.86, 4.96], [19, 4.96, 5.06], [20, 5.06, 5.22], [21, 5.22, 5.56], [22, 5.56, 6.58], [23, 6.58, 6.82], [24, 6.82, 7.24], [25, 7.24, 7.42], [26, 7.42, 7.74], [27, 7.74, 8.26]]}, {"text": "```ruby reports_controller.rb class ReportsController < ApplicationController before_action :set_report, only: [:show] before_filter :authenticate_user!", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9b20feca0c72f5e7b0f458eb061a9d29b91c6749186b7e5dbea6834dee14f2c2.mp3"}, {"text": "load_and_authorize_resource", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/27aaf89af070c42fc8b72871c8ec6c749f7e1225c81813b9290eff88b3cdeef7.mp3"}, {"text": "def index", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8d072a57be706dae5c404efd059c84bf619ce1f693dd89c0ae340b38b7a2e9ef.mp3"}, {"text": "end", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/940bb3913e4a6d466b772ec7cf440dec964b0e0551a5294b53284a8004259eb9.mp3"}, {"text": "def show", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/60cc62b4ee9bfe6b5f42db5d8e962964e2d86bb1138c329e33edfe09f6f36753.mp3"}, {"text": "end", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/940bb3913e4a6d466b772ec7cf440dec964b0e0551a5294b53284a8004259eb9.mp3"}, {"text": "private # Use callbacks to share common setup or constraints between actions.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1ffdddeaa2c3baab589f550f56bbcf286b06f45b8beef1172a872ca7bf6dd6fe.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [2, 0.66, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.46], [4, 1.46, 1.68], [5, 1.68, 1.9], [6, 1.9, 2.26], [7, 2.26, 2.6], [8, 2.6, 2.86], [9, 2.86, 3.28], [10, 3.28, 3.7], [11, 3.7, 4.12]]}, {"text": "def set_report @report = Report.find(params[:id]) end end", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f970f442add96307bc7dc9c98f0b390b1adb6dcf6c47e85d712282cb8ca021e6.mp3"}, {"text": "Here the code is stupid simple.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f255ed28bce6f19a6668b8595b3847eeb52aa61e34ab2adb63cb1a9005846ae3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.68]]}, {"text": "There isn’t any complicated formatting or send functions.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/aae9309f9d1121fca0097ca8ec28b65c4550514ef73a4c1b14c61091e59bcf16.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.7], [5, 1.7, 2.08], [7, 2.32, 2.72]]}, {"text": "All acts as a layer between the view and the data, as it should.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/02ca0b82f23438dc4fb43b4fd525eb23a86aa55ecc9c1b1054709f4df0e69b21.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [2, 0.66, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.12], [5, 1.12, 1.46], [6, 1.46, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.08], [9, 2.08, 2.2], [10, 2.2, 2.48], [11, 2.48, 2.82], [12, 2.82, 2.92], [13, 2.92, 3.14]]}, {"text": "run.json.jbuilder", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bef912255d4bad17530dcb8d1bd213d0bcebd04a39e12ca14a59bdfbbd2f1d72.mp3"}, {"text": "Json for each report gets rendered with this view method.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7b22b03893c44aba34c39a0de7d698f3874cdb884519070cccf3a80c11521213.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.42, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.42]]}, {"text": "Thanks to PGResult, you get a seperate list of the headers from the data.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c44bd6ea2999c9027add6b44af091f7d010bcb9649c3df3c93b4eacdf699b8fe.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 1.0], [4, 1.16, 1.28], [5, 1.28, 1.36], [7, 1.62, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.16], [10, 2.16, 2.36], [11, 2.36, 2.64], [12, 2.64, 2.78], [13, 2.78, 3.04]]}, {"text": "I included that seperately from the data, so that it would be easier for the Javascript to find and render the form data.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/905dd1813e2734b3fe132e7d6e2c09535b60527198406e6152be1886dcc34f98.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.8], [4, 1.36, 1.6], [5, 1.6, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.64], [8, 2.64, 2.78], [10, 2.88, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.14], [12, 3.14, 3.56], [13, 3.56, 3.82], [14, 3.82, 3.98], [15, 3.98, 4.38], [16, 4.38, 4.8], [17, 4.8, 5.1], [18, 5.1, 5.42], [19, 5.42, 5.76], [20, 5.76, 5.96], [21, 5.96, 6.22], [22, 6.22, 6.56]]}, {"text": "ruby run.json.jbuilder json.table do json.headers @results.fields json.rows @results end", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a6b68cb7fa9a4afaa72b386b67860ce5367e32916a0d4c9550d87e5264698301.mp3"}, {"text": "Pros", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b629726cd0b7234801e4206158e2f3f01af19022d4ec31a955fc5ec72c680845.mp3"}, {"text": "Hides the SQL in the database, keeping the code base clean.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b6b7e08c3becdee32beda47fcb8cc57bc5edebd17d0e41759f392644e43523fa.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [3, 0.74, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.08], [9, 2.08, 2.3], [10, 2.3, 2.62]]}, {"text": "The view is report agnostic.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d9bd4148674ee99dc5c5b2cd9887b2639b2e0164640c6979cf1764dae919da33.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [2, 0.36, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.96]]}, {"text": "You don’t have to write a separate view per report.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ca62ea9a70a4a4463809e65b40c46491b94911846cee3fb6d9543c89828900f3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 0.98], [6, 0.98, 1.28], [7, 1.28, 1.58], [8, 1.58, 1.84], [9, 1.84, 2.24]]}, {"text": "Custom SQL == more control over reports behavior", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a8774190edd67739489a13d90415e954766277e8cd03f11de317183c6bb6da26.mp3"}, {"text": "You don’t have to deploy to update a reporting query, but don’t forget to write a migration for it.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f9330ac18c03bc31f78e579281b6ef6543198121dc58f388b39ab88888ce6a6e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.5], [6, 1.5, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.5], [9, 2.5, 2.94], [10, 3.28, 3.44], [11, 3.44, 3.7], [12, 3.7, 3.98], [13, 3.98, 4.22], [14, 4.22, 4.44], [15, 4.44, 4.62], [16, 4.62, 5.08], [17, 5.08, 5.38], [18, 5.38, 5.6]]}, {"text": "Dynamically loaded via JSON, this allowing multiple clients to run reports.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f15e2ba88faed86f36c30b184b1cbea1eee05832dca8b277f6726cc8a7cab8e9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.64], [1, 0.64, 0.92], [2, 0.92, 1.14], [4, 1.84, 1.9], [5, 1.9, 2.26], [6, 2.26, 2.58], [7, 2.58, 3.02], [8, 3.02, 3.28], [9, 3.28, 3.42], [10, 3.42, 3.74]]}, {"text": "(maybe a mobile app?)", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3164638345c416cd069540f95eae826092060dfb4df97163f946b8290c360e95.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.78, 1.16], [1, 1.16, 1.32], [2, 1.32, 1.54], [3, 1.54, 1.92]]}, {"text": "Cons", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/888f900af800cdcbd6e947bed17fded4d9661d7ebf0cfc0bf47316d9b8bec67b.mp3"}, {"text": "You have to format on the database side, which makes writing the query more annoying, because you can’t use Rail’s helper methods.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ff92acbc0cfda1cbd6f1d09d80b66d6ff6f9c9f859e93718040e65389f28f7f9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.28], [6, 1.28, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 2.1], [8, 2.24, 2.34], [9, 2.34, 2.54], [10, 2.54, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.1], [12, 3.1, 3.28], [13, 3.28, 3.6], [14, 3.6, 3.94], [15, 4.24, 4.48], [16, 4.48, 4.76], [17, 4.76, 5.08], [18, 5.08, 5.26], [19, 5.26, 5.46], [20, 5.46, 5.82], [21, 5.82, 6.14]]}, {"text": "Editing Queries can be a little annoying, because you have to look up what is currently in the DB and create a migration to view it.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/06fda8eb12306308f8f3f96ef1ce97e3fb664f45101e5e84aab884eb060a0b77.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.86], [2, 0.86, 1.16], [3, 1.16, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 2.7], [10, 2.7, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.18], [13, 3.18, 3.38], [14, 3.38, 3.5], [15, 3.5, 3.76], [16, 3.76, 4.06], [17, 4.06, 4.16], [18, 4.16, 4.48], [19, 4.48, 4.8], [20, 4.8, 5.06], [21, 5.06, 5.24], [22, 5.24, 5.72], [23, 5.72, 6.02], [24, 6.02, 6.22], [25, 6.22, 6.42]]}]}